      howItWorks: ['Crankshaft pulley drives the supercharger via a serpentine or cogged belt.','Precision twin rotors or centrifugal impellers compress ambient intake air.','Compressed, high-density air feeds through an intercooler into intake manifold.','Engine injects proportionally more fuel, generating instant power on throttle opening.'],
