      implementations: ['Toyota VVT-i','Honda i-VTEC','BMW Double VANOS','Yamaha VVA'],
      vehicles: ['Toyota Camry','Honda CBR600RR','Yamaha R15 V4 (VVA)','BMW M3 (Double VANOS)'],
      source: 'SAE International, Toyota Technical Review, BMW Group Technology',
