      shortDescription: 'An energy recovery mechanism in EVs converting kinetic energy during deceleration back into stored electrical energy.',
      explanation: 'When lifting off the accelerator or braking, the electric motor switches to generator mode. The vehicle\'s kinetic energy spins the generator, producing electricity fed back into the battery. This recovers energy normally wasted as heat in friction brakes.',
