      shortDescription: 'A suite of electronic technologies using sensors, cameras, radar, and AI to assist the driver and enhance active safety.',
      explanation: 'ADAS uses cameras, radar, LiDAR, and ultrasonic sensors to perceive the vehicle\'s environment. An onboard processor interprets sensor data and can warn or autonomously correct. ADAS ranges from simple parking sensors to semi-autonomous highway driving.',
